#Data tables for asymmetric interior loops of size 3
#Free energies at 37 degrees for RNA with 1mP (1)
 
#Data Arrangement:
#For the 4x4 tables, each starting pair needs its own table.
#This is the AA table:  
#			5' --> 3'   
#			    X 
#			   A  A         
#			   U  U
#			    YA
#			3' <-- 5'   
#			    Y->          
#	   	---------------------------- 
#	(X) 	A	C	G	U  
#	 | 	----------------------------
#	 V   
#	(A) 	3.7	3.7	3.7	3.7
#	(C) 	3.7	3.7	3.7	3.7
#	(G) 	2.6	2.6	2.6	2.6
#	(U) 	3.7	3.7	3.7	3.0

#An energy of "." is "infinity," i.e. not allowed.

#		5' --> 3'
		    X
		   A  A
		   U  U
		    YA
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	----------------------------
	A	C	G	U	1
# 	----------------------------
A	2.7	2.7	2.7	2.7	2.7
C	2.7	2.7	2.7	2.7	2.7
G	1.6	1.6	1.6	1.6	1.6
U	2.7	2.7	2.7	2.0	2.0
1	2.7	2.7	2.7	0.6	1.1


